{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "weno5_eno1_signed_D1y_interior",
    "description": "Interior-only hybrid WENO5/ENO1 upwind first derivative d u/dy for the level-set REINITIALISATION equation psi_tau = S(psi_0)(1 - |grad psi|) of NCAR fire_behavior (physics/level_set_mod.F90 Advance_ls_reinit, fire_upwinding_reinit = 4), on cartesian_uniform_2d over the block [3, NX-2] x [4, NY-3]. It is stencils/weno5_eno1_D1y_interior with the two changes the reinitialisation makes, and nothing else. (1) THE UPWIND SIDE IS CHOSEN BY A SUPPLIED SIGN FIELD, not by the wind: the propagation scheme selects WENO5's side by signo = a_valor (d4 u/dy) with a_valor = grad4 u . (wind_u, wind_v) (stencils/grad4_dot_wind); the reinitialisation by s[i,j] (d4 u/dy) (stencils/central_D1y_4_point), where s is the param bound to fire_behavior's lfn_s0 -- the smoothed sign S(psi_0) = psi_0 / sqrt(psi_0^2 + dx^2), frozen at the start of the pseudo-time iteration. This stencil reads no wind. (2) THE BAND TEST IS SIGNED, NOT ABSOLUTE: ENO1 is taken when u[i,j] >= weno_band_cells * dx, whereas the propagation stencil takes it when |u[i,j]| >= weno_band_cells * dx. That is faithful to the reference code, which writes `if (lfn_curr(i, j) < threshold_hlu)` in every WENO case of Advance_ls_reinit while Calc_tend_ls writes `if (abs (lfn(i, j)) < threshold_hlu)`. The missing abs is almost certainly an oversight -- it puts the whole BURNED INTERIOR, where the level set is large and negative, on the fifth-order branch meant for the band around the front -- but it is what the model computes, and a transcription that silently inserted the abs would not reproduce it. Everything else is the propagation sibling's own pieces: the wall band (stencils/eno1_wall_band), the ENO1 branch (stencils/eno1_minmod_D1y), the WENO5 branch (stencils/weno5_js_upwind_D1y), the block bounds. Params: u, the level set, and s, the [x, y] sign field (indexed at the cell). Free names: bdy_eno1_cells, weno_band_cells, dx, dy.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:stencil",
      "family:finite_difference",
      "grid:cartesian_uniform_2d",
      "op:D",
      "axes:x,y",
      "order:1",
      "stencil_width:7"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Sussman, M., Smereka, P., & Osher, S. (1994). A level set approach for computing solutions to incompressible two-phase flow. Journal of Computational Physics, 114(1), 146-159. The reinitialisation equation psi_tau = S(psi_0)(1 - |grad psi|) with the smoothed sign S(psi_0) = psi_0/sqrt(psi_0^2 + dx^2).",
        "doi": "10.1006/jcph.1994.1155"
      },
      {
        "citation": "Munoz-Esparza, D., Kosovic, B., Jimenez, P. A., & Coen, J. L. (2018). An accurate fire-spread algorithm in the Weather Research and Forecasting model using the level-set method. Journal of Advances in Modeling Earth Systems, 10(4), 908-926. The hybrid WENO5/ENO1 level-set scheme (fire_upwinding = 9) of WRF-Fire / NCAR fire_behavior.",
        "doi": "10.1002/2017MS001108"
      },
      {
        "citation": "Jiang, G.-S., & Shu, C.-W. (1996). Efficient implementation of weighted ENO schemes. Journal of Computational Physics, 126(1), 202-228. The classical WENO5 smoothness indicators beta_k and nonlinear weights w_k = gamma_k/(beta_k + eps)^2.",
        "doi": "10.1006/jcph.1996.0130"
      },
      {
        "citation": "Harten, A., Engquist, B., Osher, S., & Chakravarthy, S. R. (1987). Uniformly high order accurate essentially non-oscillatory schemes, III. Journal of Computational Physics, 71(2), 231-303. ENO stencil selection by smallest divided difference (first-order form: the minmod limiter).",
        "doi": "10.1016/0021-9991(87)90031-3"
      },
      {
        "citation": "NCAR Community Fire Behavior Model (fire_behavior), develop @ eb77580, physics/level_set_mod.F90: Advance_ls_reinit (fire_upwinding_reinit = 4), Select_eno, Select_weno5, Select_4th, Extrapol_var_at_bdys. The transcribed reference implementation."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {
      "ref": "../grid.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "eno1_wall_band.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "eno1_minmod_D1y.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "weno5_js_upwind_D1y.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "central_D1y_4_point.esm"
    }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "weno5_eno1_signed_D1y_interior": {
      "params": [
        "u",
        "s"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "faq",
        "output_idx": [
          "i",
          "j"
        ],
        "args": [
          "u"
        ],
        "ranges": {
          "i": [
            3,
            {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
                "NX",
                2
              ]
            }
          ],
          "j": [
            4,
            {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
                "NY",
                3
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "expr": {
          "op": "ifelse",
          "args": [
            {
              "op": "or",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "apply_expression_template",
                  "args": [],
                  "name": "eno1_wall_band",
                  "bindings": {
                    "i": "i",
                    "j": "j"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "op": ">=",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": [
                        "u",
                        "i",
                        "j"
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "*",
                      "args": [
                        "weno_band_cells",
                        "dx"
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "op": "apply_expression_template",
              "args": [],
              "name": "eno1_minmod_D1y",
              "bindings": {
                "u": "u",
                "i": "i",
                "j": "j"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "apply_expression_template",
              "args": [],
              "name": "weno5_js_upwind_D1y",
              "bindings": {
                "u": "u",
                "i": "i",
                "j": "j",
                "sgn": {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": [
                        "s",
                        "i",
                        "j"
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "apply_expression_template",
                      "args": [],
                      "name": "central_D1y_4_point",
                      "bindings": {
                        "u": "u",
                        "i": "i",
                        "j": "j"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
